#: ../../source/docs/git-rebase.rst:5 5f5b2b63049d47d9be2d5a9c09350719
msgid "Rebasing: keeping your code up to date"
msgstr "变基：保持代码最新"

#: ../../source/docs/git-rebase.rst:10 02d619ce253b4482b3ffb4e50c7b9afd
msgid ""
"As you develop, ArduPilot's master  branch is likely to be updated with "
"\"commits\" from other developers. You should `keep your local branches and "
"fork up to date <http://robots.thoughtbot.com/keeping-a-github-fork-"
"updated>`__ so that you are working with the latest code and to make it "
"easier for maintainers to eventually merge your changes to ArduPilot's "
"master branch."
msgstr ""
"在您开发期间，ArduPilot 的 master branch 可能会被其他开发者更新并加入新的 commit。您应该 `保持本地 branch 和 "
"fork 最新 <http://robots.thoughtbot.com/keeping-a-github-fork-"
"updated>`__，以便使用最新代码，并方便维护者最终将您的更改合并到 ArduPilot 的 master branch。"

#: ../../source/docs/git-rebase.rst:14 e333c14b3e684eb99d82b810ab9f3fd9
msgid ""
"In particular it is best to keep your local repo and forked repo's master "
"branches up-to-date with ArduPilot's master branch."
msgstr ""
"特别是，最好将本地仓库和 fork 仓库的 master branch 与 ArduPilot 的 master branch 保持同步更新。"

#: ../../source/docs/git-rebase.rst:16 2da4b8db4c8a406f8eec004a3a5ce0c1
msgid ""
"\"Rebasing\" allows you to update a branch from ArduPilot's master branch "
"and then re-apply any changes you may have made to the branch."
msgstr ""
"「变基」允许您将 branch 从 ArduPilot 的 master branch 更新，然后重新应用您对该 branch 所做的任何更改。"

#: ../../source/docs/git-rebase.rst:20 724edf801eab45e78f17ca5d0d7e570d
msgid ""
"The following commands can be entered directly into a Linux/OSX terminal or "
"if using Windows, launch the \"Git Shell\" or \"Git Bash\" utility that "
"should already be :ref:`installed <git-install>`."
msgstr ""
"以下命令可直接在 Linux/OSX 终端中输入，若使用 Windows，请启动应已 :ref:`安装 <git-install>` 的「Git "
"Shell」或「Git Bash」工具。"

#: ../../source/docs/git-rebase.rst:23 5f6044f38f6e4e8ea2ea31a8dae57952
msgid "Navigate to your ardupilot git repository."
msgstr "切换到您的 ardupilot git 仓库。"

#: ../../source/docs/git-rebase.rst:29 cca11f879cf34b6cab4aed37cd1ad32e
msgid ""
"Starting from here we will assume that you want to rebase your topic-branch "
"on ArduPilot master branch. This process is the same for the master branch, "
"just replace topic-branch with master. Ensure you are looking at your master"
" branch or the branch that you want to rebase."
msgstr ""
"以下假设您要将 topic-branch 变基到 ArduPilot master branch 上。master branch 的操作流程相同，只需将"
" topic-branch 替换为 master。请确保当前处于您的 master branch 或要变基的 branch。"

#: ../../source/docs/git-rebase.rst:36 0ff756d7019a4718ae4b2d88115e6bb9
msgid ""
"If you want to create a new branch to work on which you would like to rebase"
" on top of the ArduPilot master branch,"
msgstr "若要创建一个基于 ArduPilot master branch 进行变基的新 branch，"

#: ../../source/docs/git-rebase.rst:43 fbd4966beb1e4e75ad54d0fea5091aa1
msgid ""
"Ensure your repository is connected to the upstream repository you forked "
"from."
msgstr "确保您的仓库已连接到您 fork 的上游仓库。"

#: ../../source/docs/git-rebase.rst:50 164629512d1241aaae3071a4e61be86d
msgid ""
"Fetch changes from the upstream repository (this simply downloads changes "
"into a local cache, it will not overwrite or modify your changes in any "
"way). If you are rebasing your branch on your own fork's master branch, "
"replace upstream with origin"
msgstr ""
"从上游仓库拉取更改（这只是将更改下载到本地缓存，不会以任何方式覆盖或修改您的更改）。若要将 branch 变基到自己 fork 的 master "
"branch，请将 upstream 替换为 origin"

#: ../../source/docs/git-rebase.rst:58 6acb44b586c841609684c9d0caea0341
msgid "Rebase your current branch from the upstream's master branch."
msgstr "将当前 branch 变基到上游的 master branch。"

#: ../../source/docs/git-rebase.rst:64 71c031d883764ee49bf9efc4a66b961d
msgid "Initialize and update your local repo's submodules"
msgstr "初始化并更新本地仓库的子模块"

#: ../../source/docs/git-rebase.rst:70 bc98218631974e2ea7697255bdfdd166
msgid ""
"Check that the rebase was successfull. Using cmdline (``git log --oneline "
"--decorate --all --graph`` , type q to exit) or a GUI tool like gitk, "
"sourcetree, etc. Your commits should appear on top of ArduPilot master "
"lastest commit, like show on previous picture."
msgstr ""
"验证变基是否成功。可使用命令行（``git log --oneline --decorate --all --graph``，输入 q 退出）或 "
"gitk、sourcetree 等 GUI 工具查看。您的 commit 应出现在 ArduPilot master 最新 commit "
"之上，如前图所示。"

#: ../../source/docs/git-rebase.rst:72 6fd5487c68a144f0905dc095cdceddbb
msgid "Now push the updated branch to your github repository"
msgstr "现在将更新后的 branch 推送到您的 GitHub 仓库"

#: ../../source/docs/git-rebase.rst:80 a08443b66a174c629cd8b073a4779a1b
msgid "When things go wrong"
msgstr "出现问题时"

#: ../../source/docs/git-rebase.rst:82 ad8bdb09aa21456c96e865265f05436e
msgid "The rebase step (step 5) above may fail for a few reasons:"
msgstr "上述变基步骤（第 5 步）可能因以下几种原因失败："

#: ../../source/docs/git-rebase.rst:84 c62a1b2aa3df4d088e51fd9cfe694cc5
msgid ""
"there are uncomitted changes to files in your local repo's branch.  Stage "
"and commit these changes and then try again."
msgstr "本地仓库 branch 中存在未提交的文件更改。请暂存并提交这些更改后重试。"

#: ../../source/docs/git-rebase.rst:85 20f8c4fbea0e45a0a9e623f4efe7db14
msgid ""
"there are merge conflicts meaning that another developer has changed the "
"same lines of code as your new commits have changed.  There are two choices"
msgstr "存在合并冲突，即其他开发者修改了与您的新 commit 相同的代码行。有两种处理方式"

#: ../../source/docs/git-rebase.rst:87 238cedce354441cfaae5fc8063b19bff
msgid ""
"abort the rebase which will restore your branch to how it was before you "
"began the rebase, ``git rebase --abort``.  If you are happy to throw away "
"your new commits in your local repo's branch you can \"reset\" your branch "
"so that it looks exactly like upstream master using ``git reset --hard "
"upstream/master``."
msgstr ""
"中止变基，使 branch 恢复到开始变基之前的状态：``git rebase --abort``。若希望放弃本地 branch 中的新 "
"commit，可使用 ``git reset --hard upstream/master`` 将 branch「重置」为与上游 master "
"完全一致。"

#: ../../source/docs/git-rebase.rst:88 145a998debf449049f42984476cfad5a
msgid ""
"user a merge tool like `TortoiseGit <https://tortoisegit.org/>`__ to resolve"
" the mergeconflict and then continue with the rebase using ``git rebase "
"--continue``"
msgstr ""
"使用 `TortoiseGit <https://tortoisegit.org/>`__ 等合并工具解决合并冲突，然后使用 ``git rebase "
"--continue`` 继续变基"

#: ../../source/docs/git-rebase.rst:90 c8d50373cf5040fcb20f945a42e33563
msgid ""
"The submodule update (step 6) occasionally fails if new submodules have been"
" added.  ``git submodule init`` usually resolves this."
msgstr "若添加了新子模块，子模块更新（第 6 步）偶尔会失败。通常运行 ``git submodule init`` 可解决此问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/git-rebase.rst:92 3f6a0e2ddf344f25a8667b835b158818
msgid ""
"The push step (step 7) above may fail if your :ref:`fork <git-fork>`'s "
"branch has already been updated previously.  You can \"force\" the push "
"using ``git push -f`` which will overwrite your github fork's branch to look"
" like your local repo's branch. It will also fail if the topic-branch does "
"not already exist in your remote repository. In that case use"
msgstr ""
"若您的 :ref:`fork <git-fork>` 的 branch 已被提前更新，推送步骤（第 7 步）可能会失败。可使用 ``git push "
"-f`` 「强制」推送，以将 GitHub fork 的 branch 覆盖为与本地仓库 branch 一致。若 topic-branch "
"在远程仓库中尚不存在，也会失败，此时请使用"

#: ../../source/docs/git-rebase.rst:98 f006f3011e504423816f2318f5113c5f
msgid "to create the branch there and have your local topic-branch track it."
msgstr "在远程创建该 branch 并让本地 topic-branch 跟踪它。"
